Z||000004||Leadfoot||08-13-2001||11:33 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by hyhy4u:<BR><B>I knew it was to good to be true!!..not quite fixed yet   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> . Now it vibrates when ever i turn a corner or i start out driving from a stop..now what????</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Check to see if your exhaust system isn't touching somewhere.  The pipe off the Y connector might be touching the cradle assembly.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000005||862M4inCA||08-13-2001||01:54 PM||||Might not hurt to double check all your mounts to make sure they're tight, as well as in good condition especially if one of them was missing a bolt since the other mounts had to take up the slack that the loose one allowed. Definately not a good thing considering a lot of us still have original tranny mounts.||||reg||1
